+ * Coverage groups:
+ *   - Auth/authorization (public read, admin-only writes)
+ *   - CRUD happy paths
+ *   - Validation: required fields, price > 0, quantity >= 0, sku unique
+ *   - Attribute round-trip (object in -> object out, malformed -> 400)
+ *   - Soft vs force delete
